# Normalize line endings: shell scripts must be LF (CRLF breaks POSIX sh).
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf

# PowerShell scripts keep CRLF-friendly handling but remain UTF-8 (with BOM).
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Keep text files autocrlf-normalized.
*.py text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf

# 冻结数据文件（evaluation 的 cases.jsonl 等）：钉进 suite_manifest 的摘要按字节算，
# 检出侧若按开发者 core.autocrlf 插回 CR，同一个套件就有两个哈希（CI 检出 LF blob、
# Windows 工作副本 CRLF），完整性门禁于是本地恒绿、CI 恒红。
*.jsonl text eol=lf
